OL,3,AYouTuber arrested after popular Indian
OL,4,Afinance influencer's suicide
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 27-year-old finance influencer's
OL,7,Fsuicide in India has been mired in
OL,8,Fallegations of cyberbullying and
OL,9,Fstarted a conversation around who
OL,10,Fshould give financial advice to
OL,11,Finvestors.
OL,13,FV Harish - who ran a hugely popular
OL,14,FInstagram account called "Finance with
OL,15,FHarish" - was found dead on Tuesday
OL,16,Fmorning at his home near Chennai,
OL,17,Fcapital of the southern state of Tamil
OL,18,FNadu.
OL,20,FHis suicide came just weeks after his
OL,21,Faccount was disabled by Meta after
OL,22,Fcomplaints of irregularities.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
